   <narrative xml:lang="SV">3-&#xE5;rigt st&#xF6;d till AFRICOM (International Council of African Museums). St&#xF6;det ska anv&#xE4;ndas till att utveckla organisationens institutionella kapacitet och n&#xE4;tverk med syfte att etablera en oberoende och v&#xE4;lorganiserad NGO (n&#xE4;tverk) f&#xF6;r museiverksamhet i Afrika.Regional sharing of experiences in this area plays a key role in enhancing understanding between different cultures and promote capacity.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A three-year support to AFRICOM (International Council of African Museums). The contribution shall be used for developing the  institutional capacities and networking of the organisation with the purpose to establish an independent and well-organised pan-African NGO.Regional sharing of experiences in this area plays a key role in enhancing understanding between different cultures and promote capaci</narrative>
